          "field": "summary",
          "value": "A new \"Sumikko Gurashi\" Sugoroku party game (backgammon) for families and friends to enjoy together!\n\nSumikko and they friends are going on a dream trip around the world! Roll the dice, collect \"Tapi-miles\" on the way, and aim for your destination! The Sumikko who collects the most Tapi Miles will win!\n\nThe map of Sugoroku (backgammon) is full of various tricks! You can meet a variety of Minikko during the game, and the excellent concierge will offer you unexpected services... In addition, the game includes 30 mini-games that can be played with friends, family, or up to four people.",
